{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And of the dust that is on the floor of the Tabernacle</b> In the Yerushalmi: why water and dust? Water from the place she came, dust to the place she goes. And it is written that she is destined to give an accounting." "<b>on the floor</b> — ב' in the Masorah: here and the other: ואם יסתרו מנגד עיני בקרקע הים (Job 38:16). Meaning: ואם יסתרו מנגד עיני — she was hidden and concealed from her husband's eyes; בקרקע הים — he examines her by means of קרקע and ים, i.e., water and dust." "<b>on the floor of the Tabernacle</b> — עי״ן is elevated, because the eye of an adulterer watches for nightfall, saying: Let no eye see me."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:11.120275757Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}